One way to do this is to use an if-elif-else ladder.
Here's an example implementation:
year = 2000
if year % 100 == 0:
    if year % 400 == 0:
        leap_year = True
    else:
        leap_year = False
else:
    if year % 4 == 0:
        leap_year = True
    else:
        leap_year = False
print("Leap year:", leap_year)
